  "mechanicalNotes": [
    "Diplomacy proficiency, added languages, the fey summon guard, all Fey Empathy and Fey Stalker scaling bonuses, cold-iron natural attacks, the fey spell-resistance bonus, Beguiling Immunity, and both First World Deceiver forms and duration are automated."
  ],
